  loops precede the l_663=-10 backedge, before g_105 increments. Both
  observations retain count 1 and g_64=&g_54. l_669 is wrapping u32.
* base/223, func_31:350–607. g_129.f4=16==36 skips the first body. At the
  observed g_5=0, safe unsigned (1<=g_5)-g_5 is zero. The else arm's 31
  iterations reset the same object to zero; its inner 0==-11 loop is skipped.
  g_129.f6=0x3a is separate and unchanged, so the caller restarts.
* base/322, func_1:173–356 and func_7:506–949. func_19 resets g_6 to 4;
  func_15's 0==44 loop is skipped and returns 26, leaving l_14[0] nonzero.
  func_22 changes g_30/g_26/g_37, not g_6. The g_298.f5 loop is SIGNED and
  finite. In func_7's later 16,12,...,-20 loop, the narrowed numerator is
  22346 and divisor -10, so remainder 6 selects the arm not writing g_6.
  The next nonzero-object loop breaks, func_92 changes no object, and the
