  The sampled finite callee loop alone would not establish the cause.
* base/345, func_1:107–332, func_2:340–429. func_2's argument loop ends at
  28 and its first g_296 iteration returns that value. Called func_16/30/35
  do not write the independent g_90 guard; the huge func_30 body is skipped
  by unsigned 0>=2. Main compares 28 to UINT64_MAX-9, selects its non-returning
