* bitfields/21, func_49:1596–1767. The nonnull l_60 sets g_20[0]=0 and
  selects the false arm. Signed p_51 runs 0,-8,-16; its first iteration runs
  five middle iterations, the next two one each. Signed p_50's 5..26 and
