(E1003); moving the declaration out fixes the test source. Combining eight
transitions of all controls exceeded the CLI's 100,000-step EvoIR fuel;
two transitions plus zero/alternate controls fit the unchanged CLI limit.
These were reduction construction issues, not original compiler bug fixes.
